        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "notes.md",
          "contents": "## Original Dataset\nPaste the first version of your dataset here before asking AI Tutor to change it.\n\n\n\n## Prompts I Used\nFor each step, copy the prompt you used. \n**Step 1: Generate data:**\n\n\n**Step 2: Add a field:**\n\n\n**Step 3: Make one more change:**\n\n\n**Step 4: Restore the original:**\n\n\n## Compare\n1. What did AI Tutor restore correctly?\n\n\n2. What was different from the original?\n\n\n3. Why might an app need to save a separate copy of data before changing it?\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
        "5": {
          "id": "5",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <title>Dataset Viewer</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <main class=\"layout\">\n      <section>\n        <h2>Dataset Viewer</h2>\n        <div id=\"data-records\" class=\"card-grid\"></div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <script src=\"helpers.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "6": {
          "id": "6",
          "name": "style.css",
          "contents": "body {\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 32px;\n  background: #eef2f7;\n  color: #222;\n}\n\n.layout {\n  max-width: 1000px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n\nsection {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #d7deea;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 24px;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(31, 41, 55, 0.08);\n}\n\nh2 {\n  margin: 0 0 18px;\n  font-size: 1.3rem;\n  color: #1f2937;\n}\n\n.card-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: #f9fafb;\n  border: 1px solid #e1e7ef;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card p {\n  margin: 8px 0;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n.label {\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: #374151;\n}\n\n.missing {\n  color: #9a3412;\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 800px) {\n  body {\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .layout {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "7": {
          "id": "7",
          "name": "helpers.js",
          "contents": "const showValue = (value) => {\n  if (value === null || value === undefined || value === \"\") {\n    return \"<span class='missing'>Missing data</span>\";\n  }\n  \n  return value;\n};\n\nconst showDataCards = (records) => {\n  const dataRecords = document.querySelector(\"#data-records\");\n  dataRecords.innerHTML = \"\";\n  \n  for (let i = 0; i < records.length; i++) {\n    const card = document.createElement(\"div\");\n    card.classList.add(\"card\");\n    \n    let cardHTML = \"\";\n    \n    const keys = Object.keys(records[i]);\n    for (let j = 0; j < keys.length; j++) {\n      const key = keys[j];\n      cardHTML += `<p><strong>${key}:</strong> ${showValue(records[i][key])}</p>`;\n    }\n    \n    card.innerHTML = cardHTML;\n    dataRecords.appendChild(card);\n  }\n};\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        }
      },
