    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Explore: Can AI Undo Data Changes?\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Test whether AI can restore a dataset after changing it.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**1. Generate data.**\r\n\r\n* Ask AI Tutor to create a dataset in `script.js` with 5–8 records and 3–4 fields.\r\n* Copy the original dataset into `notes.md`.\r\n\r\n**2. Change the data.**\r\n\r\n* Ask AI Tutor to add a new field.\r\n* Then ask AI Tutor to make one more change.\r\n\r\n**3. Try to undo.**\r\n\r\n* Ask AI Tutor to restore the original dataset.\r\n* Compare the restored dataset to the original in `notes.md`.\r\n* Record what changed.",
